abstract: "Negative-result security research on the Cloudflare PHP CTF (php-rce.cloudflare.app): the complete three-stage php2shell chain (CVE-2026-109618/109619) — session-state OOM arm, overlong Set-Cookie heap disclosure, ROP RCE — built and verified against a byte-comparable lab replica of the challenge sandbox, plus original findings (cookie-emission laws, armed-state walk oracle, byte-exact state razor, forge mechanics) and a proof that the surviving arm method is fused with Cloudflare's WAF OOM detections (divisor argument on 53,320 nesting units)."
